   427	the text above. `Cert c I`, `Refutation c I` and `RefutationFamily c I`
   428	take `c : ClaimSpec K` and `I : K.Inst`. `inhabited` needs the trigger
   429	at a time of at least `H` (the late trigger). The Outage persistence
