/Users/francesco/ethereum/research/async-resilient-committees/tip-stability/codex/root-design.md:227:**Minimal variant and implementation order.** Keep the existing generic predicates, regime fields, claim IDs, and raw block constructors. Add the helper codec and proofs in a new module. Change the three constructors, the two base admission handlers, and all three independent wire validators; SA inherits its implementation. Add the four public `rootInjective_of_execution` theorems and the Grid CO lease-policy generalization. Keep existing downstream proof signatures while repairing their local assumptions. Supply convenience constructors or corollaries which fill the root field from `execution`. The user of a fixed-protocol theorem then provides execution validity and the other regime facts, not a separate collision premise.
