codex
The proposed MATRIX format needs rules for status and instance identity. A conditional certificate can otherwise appear as `cert`, and the current instance-name extractor reads SA-PC’s base instance as `StrongInstance.toInstance`.

I also found a conflict in Task 1: it promises that later proposal exclusions will require changes only in WindowMargin, but it keeps two relay proofs tied to “proposals are never excluded.” I will separate these required fixes from the parts that the code supports.

